  "terrainName": "basic-desert",
  "description": "What: CE-6006 feature scenario (showcase world, DESIGN_City_Battle_Showcase V-1a) - on open basic-desert, two bulldozers (TKB 112, inert, Health 1000) 600 m apart. 'Dozer Rifle' is shot at by a four-man rifle squad from 60 m; 'Dozer RPG' by one RPG man (four rockets) from 50 m. Judge: (1) the squad hits 'Dozer Rifle' many times and it is NOT hurt (small arms do nothing to its 40-50 mm steel) (2) the RPG man's rockets hit 'Dozer RPG': it is still alive after the 2nd and dead after the 3rd. Fail: any health lost to rifles, dead after 2 rockets, alive after 3. Check: Hrot.ClusterRunner --mode editor --headless --verify bulldozer-armour"
 },
